README.md
     1	# Isle of Berk Performance Patches
     2	
     3	[![Release](https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Vonix-Network/isleofberk-performance-patches?label=release)](https://github.com/Vonix-Network/isleofberk-performance-patches/releases)
     4	[![Minecraft](https://img.shields.io/badge/Minecraft-1.18.2-62b47a)](https://www.minecraft.net/)
     5	[![Forge](https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-40.3.x-orange)](https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/)
     6	[![Java](https://img.shields.io/badge/Java-17-red)](https://adoptium.net/)
     7	
     8	A standalone Forge Mixin companion that applies Vonix performance patches to **Isle of Berk 1.2.0** on **Minecraft 1.18.2**.
     9	
    10	> **This is a companion, not a fork or replacement.** Keep the original `isleofberk-1.2.0.jar` installed. This project does not redistribute Isle of Berk classes or resources and does not include the separate `isleofberk-deadlockfix` mod.
    11	
    12	## Download
    13	
    14	- [Latest GitHub release](https://github.com/Vonix-Network/isleofberk-performance-patches/releases/latest)
    15	- [Version 1.0.0](https://github.com/Vonix-Network/isleofberk-performance-patches/releases/tag/v1.0.0)
    16	- [Download the 1.0.0 JAR](https://github.com/Vonix-Network/isleofberk-performance-patches/releases/download/v1.0.0/isleof-berk-performance-patches-1.0.0.jar)
    17	
    18	### 1.0.0 artifact integrity
    19	
    20	Stable promotion of the current companion. Forge compile pin remains 40.3.0. Earlier `0.3.x` tags stay immutable.
