      "impact": "Historical build/runtime success cannot establish that this exact HEAD and exact release JAR applied correctly or coexisted with current Variant Loader and deadlock-fix versions.",
      "exact_repair": "Replace or clearly archive the old report. Produce a 1.0.0 report pinned to this HEAD/tree/JAR, with current eight-resource results, dependency digests, post-transform checks, and fresh client/server coexistence evidence."
